   },
   {
    "str": "Forty seconds into our first qualifying match, our robot drove straight into the wall and stayed there.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 554.5,
    "width": 524.9,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "The crowd groaned. Our drive team turned and looked at me, because I had written the",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 540,
    "width": 462.9,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "autonomous code, and I had told everyone it was ready.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 525.5,
    "width": 298.16,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "That night I did what I always do. Every day after school, I stayed in the robotics lab until seven,",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 497,
    "width": 506.92,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "and that week I stayed until the custodian turned off the hallway lights. As lead programmer, I had",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 482.5,
    "width": 517.6,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "tested every line on a practice field that was two inches shorter than the real one. Debugging",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 468,
    "width": 491.58,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "taught me that the problem is almost never where I first look. The bug hides one layer down, in the",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 453.5,
    "width": 521.58,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "assumption I was too sure of to question.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 439,
    "width": 218.11,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "On Saturday and Sunday mornings I work at Cascade Crumb Bakery, where I unlock the door at",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 410.5,
    "width": 511.56,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "five and shape the first loaves before the sun is up. Bread is patient in a way that code is not. If the",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 396,
    "width": 522.96,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "dough is cold, it simply waits, and I have learned to wait with it. Mrs. Alvarez, the owner, never tells",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 381.5,
    "width": 523.54,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "me when a loaf is finished. She hands it to me and asks how it sounds when I tap the bottom.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 367,
    "width": 494.93,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "Last summer I brought that same patience to a research question: why do cheap soil moisture",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 338.5,
    "width": 498.23,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "sensors drift over a growing season? I buried twelve of them in my neighbor’s garden and logged",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 324,
    "width": 514.24,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "readings every hour for six weeks. Most of the drift came from temperature, not age, which",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 309.5,
    "width": 480.19,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "surprised both me and my mentor. The project won first place at the state science fair, but the",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 295,
    "width": 496.22,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "result I am proudest of is a correction table that our school garden club now uses every spring.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 280.5,
    "width": 500.89,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "I think about that wall a lot. We fixed the robot before our next match by measuring the real field",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 252,
    "width": 506.92,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "instead of trusting my numbers, and we made it to the semifinals. Since then I start every project,",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 237.5,
    "width": 514.22,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "from a tutoring lesson to a sourdough starter, by asking what I am assuming. It is a small question,",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 223,
    "width": 522.23,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "but it has made me slower to be certain and quicker to learn. I don’t think I will ever stop being the",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 208.5,
    "width": 518.24,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "person who checks the field.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 194,
    "width": 151.4,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   }
