    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f1"
   },
   {
    "str": "The community I care about most meets in Room 114 on Tuesday and Thursday afternoons. Since",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 544,
    "width": 524.9,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "I started the tutoring club in 2023, it has grown from three friends with a whiteboard to fourteen",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 529.5,
    "width": 500.92,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "tutors and more than sixty students. As captain of the varsity soccer team, I already knew how to",
    "x": 36,
