    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "run a practice, so I ran our sessions the same way: a short warmup problem, small groups, and",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 500.5,
    "width": 504.86,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "one question everyone answers out loud.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 486,
    "width": 218.78,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "Tutoring changed how I explain things. Debugging taught me that the problem is almost never",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 457.5,
    "width": 497.58,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "where I first look. The bug hides one layer down, in the assumption I was too sure of to question.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 443,
    "width": 512.26,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "Math works the same way. When a student is stuck on a geometry proof, the mistake is usually two",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 428.5,
    "width": 526.21,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "steps earlier, in a line they wrote down without thinking.",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 414,
    "width": 293.46,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
   {
    "str": "I want to keep building communities like this one in college, through peer tutoring and student",
    "x": 36,
    "y": 385.5,
    "width": 494.92,
    "height": 12,
    "font": "g_d0_f2"
   },
